<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Swedish May c/a deficit 1.5 bln skr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Swedish May c/a deficit 1.5 bln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's current account for May showed a deficit of 1.5 billion crowns for a surplus of 38.3 billion in the previous 12 months, Sweden's central bank, or Riksbank, said on Monday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH CURRENT ACCOUNT	 May 97     April 97   May 96</p>
<p> Monthly balance		   -1.5	  5.6	  0.2</p>
<p> Previous 12 months		38.3	 40.0	 43.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in billions of crowns. Average market expectations had been for a surplus of 1.1 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
